@local/dsh-qwen-mode README · dsh-qwen-mode：Requires a provider that exposes the `qoder` models (see `dsh-qoder-provider`). With the
provider in `display` mode the tools would be shadowed by the provider's own copies; this
preset deliberately does not mount those.

@local/dsh-qwen-mode README · 与标准模式的差别：1. `id` / 名称 / 说明 / `order`：它是一个独立可选的会话模式。
2. 不挂 `qwen-display`（旧「照搬显示」那套影子工具）。drive 模式下工具由 DSH 真执行，
   挂影子工具只会把它们遮蔽成空转。
